    "html": "<p>The graph shows how the force acting on an object varies with time.</p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>At <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=0\"></span> the object is at rest and at <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=15\"></span> s the speed of the object is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"25\"></span> m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. What is the mass of the object?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1000\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2000\"></span> kg</li>\n</ol>"
